 "result": "I documented 12 repos this run and pushed all of them. No repo was unreachable.\n\nFour were new backfills: 2026-11-16-pipe-weave, 2026-11-15-orange-keydecode, lartte and 2026-11-16-orange-zion. Eight were updates with new commits: mobbyhill, the Agent Test Bed, raineurysm, city-seek, delivery-twin, itchy-troll, the Hush app and the Score Hub. Hush and the Score Hub already had changelog entries from their developer agents, so they only got release jobs and a state refresh.\n\nNone of the repos needed a root vercel.json. I also refreshed the profile in sudosilo/sudosilo, saved the state files and publish jobs to control-troll main as \"scribe state\", and added a note to agents/notes/general.md. I did not condense that notes file, which is now well over 40 lines.\n\nThree repos remain in the backfill queue: control-troll, heckle-troll and sudosilo. They have empty app entries on purpose. Several other repos had pushes after their last recorded one, such as mohavetech-website and field-twin. I did not check them this run, so they come first next time.",
